  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Parking Meter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"app-title\">\n    <h1 id=\"app-title\">Pixel Parking Meter</h1>\n    <div class=\"display\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n      <div class=\"time\" id=\"time-display\">0:00</div>\n      <div class=\"price\" id=\"price-display\">$0.00</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"add15\" class=\"btn\" aria-label=\"Add 15 minutes\">+15 min</button>\n      <button id=\"add60\" class=\"btn\" aria-label=\"Add 60 minutes\">+60 min</button>\n      <button id=\"clear\" class=\"btn clear\" aria-label=\"Clear all time\">Clear</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"hint\">Maximum 3 hours (180 minutes)</p>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": "* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\n[hidden] {\n  display: none !important;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  background: #1e2a3a;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 16px;\n  color: #e8edf2;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: #2c3e50;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  color: #f0c040;\n  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n}\n\n.display {\n  background: #1a252f;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 20px;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.time {\n  font-size: 2.5rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  color: #f0c040;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n}\n\n.price {\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  color: #8fa8c0;\n  margin-top: 4px;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.btn {\n  flex: 1 1 auto;\n  min-width: 100px;\n  padding: 14px 20px;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  border: 2px solid transparent;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  background: #3d5a73;\n  color: #e8edf2;\n  transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.1s, border-color 0.15s;\n  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n}\n\n.btn:hover {\n  background: #4a6b87;\n}\n\n.btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: none;\n  border-color: #f0c040;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(240, 192, 64, 0.4);\n}\n\n.btn:active {\n  transform: scale(0.97);\n  background: #2f4a60;\n}\n\n.btn:disabled {\n  opacity: 0.4;\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n  transform: none;\n}\n\n.btn:disabled:hover {\n  background: #3d5a73;\n}\n\n.btn.clear {\n  background: #c0392b;\n  color: #fff;\n}\n\n.btn.clear:hover {\n  background: #d64535;\n}\n\n.btn.clear:active {\n  background: #a93226;\n}\n\n.hint {\n  margin-top: 20px;\n  font-size: 0.875rem;\n  color: #8fa8c0;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 360px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n  }\n  .btn {\n    min-width: 80px;\n    padding: 12px 14px;\n  }\n  .time {\n    font-size: 2rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "(function () {\n  'use strict';\n\n  var MAX_MINUTES = 180;\n  var RATE_PER_HOUR = 2.00;\n\n  var timeDisplay = document.getElementById('time-display');\n  var priceDisplay = document.getElementById('price-display');\n  var add15Btn = document.getElementById('add15');\n  var add60Btn = document.getElementById('add60');\n  var clearBtn = document.getElementById('clear');\n\n  var totalMinutes = 0;\n\n  function formatTime(minutes) {\n    var h = Math.floor(minutes / 60);\n    var m = minutes % 60;\n    return h + ':' + (m < 10 ? '0' : '') + m;\n  }\n\n  function formatPrice(minutes) {\n    var price = (minutes / 60) * RATE_PER_HOUR;\n    return '$' + price.toFixed(2);\n  }\n\n  function updateDisplay() {\n    timeDisplay.textContent = formatTime(totalMinutes);\n    priceDisplay.textContent = formatPrice(totalMinutes);\n\n    add15Btn.disabled = totalMinutes + 15 > MAX_MINUTES;\n    add60Btn.disabled = totalMinutes + 60 > MAX_MINUTES;\n    clearBtn.disabled = totalMinutes === 0;\n  }\n\n  function addMinutes(minutes) {\n    if (totalMinutes + minutes <= MAX_MINUTES) {\n      totalMinutes += minutes;\n      updateDisplay();\n    }\n  }\n\n  add15Btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    addMinutes(15);\n  });\n\n  add60Btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    addMinutes(60);\n  });\n\n  clearBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    totalMinutes = 0;\n    updateDisplay();\n  });\n\n  updateDisplay();\n})();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Parking Meter\n\nA self-contained browser app that simulates a parking meter. Add 15 or 60 minutes with buttons (maximum 3 hours), see the paid time as h:mm and the price at $2.00 per hour to two decimals, and clear the meter with the Clear button.\n\n## Features\n\n- Add 15 or 60 minutes with labeled buttons\n- Maximum 3 hours (180 minutes) enforced; buttons disable when limit reached\n- Time displayed as h:mm (e.g., 1:15)\n- Price displayed as $0.00 (two decimals) at $2.00/hour\n- Clear button resets time and price\n- Fully keyboard accessible with visible focus states\n- Responsive from 360px wide\n- No external dependencies, network requests, or inline event handlers\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. Use the buttons to add time or clear the meter.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — structure and controls\n- `style.css` — styling and responsive layout\n- `script.js` — meter logic and state management\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
